{
  "upload_type": "dataset",
  "title": "WIMSTA Formula Registry: body-composition and energy-expenditure equations with primary sources",
  "creators": [
    {
      "name": "WIMSTA"
    }
  ],
  "license": "cc-by-4.0",
  "description": "<p>Open registry of 26 published equations for body composition and energy expenditure (categories: body-fat, body-fat-ranges, bmi, waist-to-height, max-heart-rate, bmr, ideal-weight, bsa), each with its primary source, coefficients, input list, sex coding, units, reported error, sample and limitations. Each entry records how it was verified: 13 against the primary publication, the rest against secondary sources only.</p><p>Includes test vectors (254 input → output cases from the reference implementation, cross-checked against the live WIMSTA calculation API). Human-readable pages: <a href=\"https://wimsta.com/registry/\">https://wimsta.com/registry/</a>.</p><p>Estimates for general information only; not medical advice.</p>",
  "keywords": [
    "body composition",
    "body fat",
    "basal metabolic rate",
    "BMI",
    "waist-to-height ratio",
    "maximum heart rate",
    "anthropometry",
    "equations"
  ],
